WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.801
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:05.767
I am your host,
Shipwrecked Jimmy Fallon.

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:10.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:12.901
Yeah, I finally did it --
I went through puberty.

00:00:12.901 --> 00:00:14.868
Yeah.

00:00:14.868 --> 00:00:16.000
Really cool.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.968
I like it. Thank you.
Appreciate it.

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:23.100
Yes, I've grown a beard,
and, yes,

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.234
this definitely won't help with
people confusing me for

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:28.634
Jimmy Kimmel.

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:30.434
I want to get to the point
where I can annoy people

00:00:30.434 --> 00:00:34.467
by taking out a tiny beard comb
at the dinner table.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:35.534
But enough about me.

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:36.834
What a show we have
for you today.

00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:39.400
Hillary and Chelsea Clinton
are my guests tonight.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.234
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yes!

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.601
That's right.

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:52.267
Right now, Hillary's on her
nationwide "I Told You So" tour.

00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:53.667
Well, guys,
let's get to some news.

00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:55.734
Yesterday, President Biden
was delivering a speech

00:00:55.734 --> 00:00:58.434
in Wisconsin where he
was interrupted by a heckler.

00:00:58.434 --> 00:01:00.100
Can we see the
president's response?

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.601
-By the way --
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:04.801
Alright! God love you.

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:07.567
Let him go.

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:09.467
Let him go.

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:15.133
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no,
no, no, don't --

00:01:15.133 --> 00:01:16.234
Let him go.

00:01:16.234 --> 00:01:17.400
Let him -- He's --

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.067
Look, everybody's entitled
to be an idiot.

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:23.167
No, no,
everybody's entitled, okay?

00:01:23.167 --> 00:01:26.534
-"Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no,
no, no, no, no.

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:27.634
♪♪

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:31.934
No, no, no, no,
no, no, no, no, no."

00:01:31.934 --> 00:01:33.901
Everyone's entitled to be
an idiot.

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:36.901
Yeah, that sounds like something
your mom would say

00:01:36.901 --> 00:01:39.334
after your dad insists
he can fix the dishwasher.

00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:41.501
Yeah. "Everyone's entitled
to be an idiot.

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:42.567
Go ahead."

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:46.968
"You put this, uh --
Put that..."

00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:50.133
I also am pretty sure
that's the first insult to ever

00:01:50.133 --> 00:01:53.801
start with the phrase
"God love you."

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:55.334
No, no, no, no, no.

00:01:55.334 --> 00:01:56.934
After a few more
seconds of heckling,

00:01:56.934 --> 00:01:58.901
security was like,
"Okay, that's enough, Mr. Trump.

00:01:58.901 --> 00:02:01.267
Please -- Just please."

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:03.367
Yep, Biden wasn't pulling
any punches yesterday.

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:05.534
He also went after
far-right Republicans

00:02:05.534 --> 00:02:07.968
and referred to them
as "Trumpies."

00:02:07.968 --> 00:02:09.434
Trumpies sounds like
a breakfast cereal

00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:11.400
that's all marshmallows.

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.601
Right? You want some Trumpies?

00:02:20.634 --> 00:02:22.100
Trumpies sounds like
a word for when

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.767
a toddler gets grumpy
on a train.

00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:26.501
Like, "Uh-oh, he's got a little
case of the Trumpies."

00:02:30.634 --> 00:02:32.267
Trumpies sounds like
something you catch from

00:02:32.267 --> 00:02:33.467
hooking up in a hot tub.

00:02:33.467 --> 00:02:36.400
"Hey, I just found out
I have Trumpies.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.767
You should
get yourself checked."

00:02:39.767 --> 00:02:41.000
Speaking of
the former president,

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.501
a federal judge unsealed
the list of materials

00:02:43.501 --> 00:02:45.567
seized from Mar-a-Lago,
and it revealed that Trump

00:02:45.567 --> 00:02:47.701
had classified documents
mixed in with

00:02:47.701 --> 00:02:50.534
newspaper clippings,
magazines, and clothing.

00:02:50.534 --> 00:02:54.567
Even T.J.Maxx was like, "Dude,
get it together in there."

00:02:56.267 --> 00:02:58.234
That's right --
Trump had classified documents

00:02:58.234 --> 00:03:00.567
mixed in with
newspaper clippings, magazines,

00:03:00.567 --> 00:03:02.601
photographs, and even clothing,
but right now,

00:03:02.601 --> 00:03:04.667
millions of people
are still defending Trump.

00:03:04.667 --> 00:03:06.000
[ Glass shatters ]

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.067
What was that?

00:03:07.067 --> 00:03:08.467
-Oh, nothing -- nothing, Jimmy.

00:03:08.467 --> 00:03:11.167
I just found your monologue
very funny tonight.

00:03:11.167 --> 00:03:13.801
That's all. Just keep telling
your funny jokes.

00:03:13.801 --> 00:03:17.601
-Oh, yeah. I will.
Thank you. Thank you.

00:03:17.601 --> 00:03:19.801
Meanwhile, a judge just
granted Trump's request

00:03:19.801 --> 00:03:22.901
for a special master
to review all the documents

00:03:22.901 --> 00:03:25.067
seized from Mar-a-Lago,
which could massively delay

00:03:25.067 --> 00:03:27.167
the Justice Department's
investigation into

00:03:27.167 --> 00:03:28.200
the former president.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.868
[ Glass shatters ]

00:03:29.868 --> 00:03:33.667
-[ Stammers ]

00:03:33.667 --> 00:03:37.634
-Can we get her a paper cup?
Get her paper cups in there.

00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:40.334
Did I mention Hillary Clinton
is on the show tonight?

00:03:40.334 --> 00:03:42.133
Hillary Clinton and Chelsea.

00:03:42.133 --> 00:03:44.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:46.534 --> 00:03:49.267
That's right --
the special master has to review

00:03:49.267 --> 00:03:52.801
over 11,000 documents, which
could delay the investigation.

00:03:52.801 --> 00:03:54.868
Man, only Trump could avoid
jail just because

00:03:54.868 --> 00:03:57.567
there's too much evidence.

